{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25990","headline":"途中旅思二首 一 · 鲍溶","name":"途中旅思二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"喔喔鸡鸣晓，萧萧马辞枥。\n草草名利区，居人少於客。\n生期三万日，童耄半虚掷。\n修短命半中，忧欢复相敌。\n朝提黄金爵，暮造青松宅。\n来往日相悲，北邙田土窄。\n峨峨西天岳，锦绣明翠壁。\n中有不死乡，千年无人迹。\n心期周太子，下马拜虚碧。\n鹤驾如可从，他年执烟策。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25990.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25990","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}